# Race Ingenior — Core

- Stack: .NET 8 WPF, CommunityToolkit.Mvvm, DI via Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting
- Product: Le Mans Ultimate race engineer (radio + telemetry + overlay)
- Chat with the user in French; all UI strings stay in English
- Never commit `secrets/gemini_api_key.txt` — only `secrets/gemini_api_key.example.txt`
- Prefer small focused changes; match existing folder layout (`Radio/`, `Telemetry/`, `Services/`, `ViewModels/`)
- After UI or service changes: `dotnet build src/RaceIngenior/RaceIngenior.csproj -c Debug` (stop `RaceIngenior` if the exe is locked)
- Version: `InformationalVersion` in `.csproj`; user-facing history in `CHANGELOG.md`
- Overlay is a topmost WPF window, not an in-game HUD injection
